WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.094 --> 00:01.164
(All characters and organizations in this drama are fictional.)

3
00:01.734 --> 00:02.734
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

4
00:02.794 --> 00:03.864
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

5
00:05.534 --> 00:07.504
(Episode 31)

6
00:07.564 --> 00:09.534
(Suragan Side Dishes)

7
00:22.254 --> 00:23.514
Darn it.

8
00:24.684 --> 00:25.954
I was going to surprise her.

9
00:26.024 --> 00:27.954
(Suragan Side Dishes)

10
00:40.264 --> 00:42.174
The call cannot be connected, so you will be connected to voicemail.

11
00:47.974 --> 00:48.974
Chef Kim.

12
00:50.774 --> 00:52.744
- Hello. - Yes, hello.

13
00:53.144 --> 00:55.654
I think you need to find Ms. Han Gyu Rim right away.

14
00:56.014 --> 00:57.014
What?

15
00:58.124 --> 00:59.524
Did something happen to Gyu Rim?

16
01:00.254 --> 01:01.254
Excuse me.

17
01:06.194 --> 01:07.964
What did you do to Gyu Young?

18
01:09.494 --> 01:10.934
Hey, move.

19
01:22.314 --> 01:24.014
I just spilled my coffee all of a sudden.

20
01:24.844 --> 01:26.914
I think I barely grazed you.

21
01:28.254 --> 01:29.614
You tried to run me over with your car last time.

22
01:29.614 --> 01:30.684
Was that on purpose too?

23
01:32.224 --> 01:33.654
Are you a real psychopath?

24
01:35.524 --> 01:37.994
What did you do to my sister?

25
01:38.594 --> 01:40.094
Darn it.

26
01:40.764 --> 01:41.764
Hey.

27
01:42.834 --> 01:45.204
I really didn't do anything.

28
01:45.834 --> 01:47.264
Even when your sister deserved to get beaten up,

29
01:47.334 --> 01:49.574
do you know how much I held myself back?

30
01:50.204 --> 01:51.604
You really are a psycho.

31
01:53.344 --> 01:54.744
You are completely out of your mind.

32
01:56.074 --> 01:57.074
You can't leave.

33
01:57.144 --> 01:59.184
What else are you going to do to my sister?

34
02:01.814 --> 02:03.584
You're never leaving, you bastard.

35
02:04.314 --> 02:06.524
Please move. Get out of my way.

36
02:07.024 --> 02:09.524
- I have to go. Please move. - Hold on.

37
02:09.994 --> 02:12.424
I'll go. You stay home.

38
02:13.564 --> 02:16.294
That jerk told me to come without you.

39
02:16.294 --> 02:17.864
I have to go.

40
02:17.934 --> 02:20.434
What on earth are you two doing right now?

41
02:20.804 --> 02:22.334
So you mean to tell me that all that nonsense...

42
02:22.774 --> 02:25.204
about having amnesia was just an act,

43
02:25.274 --> 02:27.704
and you were totally playing me for a fool?

44
02:27.774 --> 02:30.874
You two cooked this up together? What? Hemorrhoids?

45
02:31.884 --> 02:34.244
I'm sorry, Grandma. I'm so sorry.

46
02:34.514 --> 02:37.184
You can beat me to death after I get back,

47
02:37.454 --> 02:40.484
so please just let me out right now. If I don't go,

48
02:40.554 --> 02:45.224
- Han Gyu Rim might get hurt. - This is driving me crazy.

49
02:45.524 --> 02:47.194
What does Gyu Rim have to do with this?

50
02:47.424 --> 02:49.294
Why would Gyu Rim get hurt?

51
02:49.564 --> 02:52.404
Are you two just spouting whatever nonsense pops into your heads...

52
02:52.464 --> 02:54.904
to give this old woman a heart attack and kill me?

53
02:54.974 --> 02:57.504
- Please, move out of my way. - Hold on a second.

54
02:58.844 --> 03:02.074
Mom, I'll explain everything later,

55
03:02.514 --> 03:05.014
so just hold onto her tight and don't let her go anywhere.

56
03:05.414 --> 03:08.214
Her husband has completely lost his mind,

57
03:08.314 --> 03:10.014
and Gyu Rim is with that psycho right now,

58
03:10.214 --> 03:13.154
- so I have to go quickly. - I said I need to go.

59
03:13.324 --> 03:15.954
The one he wants to see is me.

60
03:16.524 --> 03:19.524
- Hurry and go, Heung Sik. - Grandma.

61
03:19.624 --> 03:21.264
If Gyu Rim is in danger,

62
03:21.324 --> 03:22.794
what are you doing standing around? Hurry up.

63
03:22.864 --> 03:23.864
Go.

64
03:23.994 --> 03:25.564
You said it was in front of subway exit five, right?

65
03:27.204 --> 03:31.004
- Mister. - I swear I will break...

66
03:31.074 --> 03:34.744
both of your legs. Once this crisis is handled,

67
03:34.804 --> 03:36.874
I will beat you within an inch of your life.

68
03:36.944 --> 03:40.684
Do not move an inch. You wretched little fox.

69
03:40.944 --> 03:43.354
You sly, conniving little wench.

70
03:43.814 --> 03:46.384
Grandmother, please!

71
03:50.424 --> 03:51.764
Mister!

72
03:53.924 --> 03:55.064
Gyu Rim.

73
04:01.404 --> 04:02.404
Yes?

74
04:02.674 --> 04:05.144
- Did you find Gyu Rim? - No.

75
04:05.474 --> 04:07.004
I checked coffee shops, diners, bars,

76
04:07.074 --> 04:08.574
all the usual places, but she is not there.

77
04:08.874 --> 04:12.844
- Should I come help you look? - No, it is fine. Hang up.

78
04:15.384 --> 04:16.454
Gyu Rim.

79
04:17.584 --> 04:19.554
What is with this woman, darn it...

80
04:25.394 --> 04:26.864
Keep messing around,

81
04:27.564 --> 04:29.234
and I will really tear you apart this time.

82
04:29.594 --> 04:31.864
I will not let you off twice because you are Gyu Young's sister.

83
04:32.164 --> 04:33.204
Understand?

84
04:37.874 --> 04:39.144
No.

85
04:39.774 --> 04:40.944
You cannot go.

86
04:41.574 --> 04:43.814
I will never let you near my Gyu Young.

87
04:43.974 --> 04:47.244
Hey, let go. Let go of me.

88
04:52.554 --> 04:54.724
Excuse me!

89
04:54.784 --> 04:57.424
- Hey, let go. - Please call the police.

90
04:57.794 --> 04:59.464
- An attempted murderer here! - Let go.

91
04:59.464 --> 05:01.094
- Please call the police. - I dare you.

92
05:01.164 --> 05:02.164
Hey.

93
05:09.404 --> 05:10.934
Darn it.

94
05:13.374 --> 05:14.644
I will not let go.

95
05:15.744 --> 05:18.074
- I will never let go. - Let go.

96
05:18.814 --> 05:20.544
You crazy witch, seriously.

97
05:23.214 --> 05:24.754
Do you want to die?

98
05:25.784 --> 05:26.854
Gyu Rim.

99
05:30.324 --> 05:31.964
You messed with the wrong person today.

100
05:32.024 --> 05:34.594
You crossed someone you should never have touched.

101
05:37.164 --> 05:38.164
Mu Jin.

102
05:38.234 --> 05:39.604
You are dead meat today, you bastard.

103
05:41.464 --> 05:43.474
Gyu Rim, are you okay?

104
05:44.574 --> 05:45.944
The police are coming.

105
05:46.944 --> 05:49.144
The police are on their way, so do not do anything.

106
05:51.444 --> 05:52.684
Darn it.

107
05:54.414 --> 05:55.654
Darn it.

108
06:12.034 --> 06:13.434
This is going to leave a scar.

109
06:13.934 --> 06:15.134
It hurts a lot, does it not?

110
06:15.634 --> 06:17.804
I am fine, it will not scar. It does not hurt at all.

111
06:17.874 --> 06:20.074
How does it not hurt when you look like this?

112
06:20.504 --> 06:23.314
Detective, can you just hold me and question me alone?

113
06:23.374 --> 06:24.974
Send her to the hospital first...

114
06:25.044 --> 06:26.614
- so she can get treated... - Mu Jin.

115
06:28.654 --> 06:30.754
He did nothing wrong, Detective.

116
06:30.814 --> 06:33.224
He only did that because he was trying to protect me.

117
06:33.284 --> 06:36.824
- Please show him leniency. - No, I do not need leniency.

118
06:36.824 --> 06:39.194
Whatever I did, I will take full responsibility for it,

119
06:39.264 --> 06:40.724
so just send Gyu Rim to the hospital first...

120
06:40.794 --> 06:43.194
to check where she is hurt with X-rays,

121
06:43.264 --> 06:47.904
- CT scans, and MRIs... - Mu Jin. Please, stop.

122
06:48.264 --> 06:51.604
Excuse me, Mr. Kim Mu Jin. You two...

123
06:51.674 --> 06:53.974
did not end up here just playing house, you know.

124
06:54.104 --> 06:57.614
Kang Sung Wook, whom you brutally beat without provocation,

125
06:57.614 --> 06:59.784
was taken to the hospital unconscious.

126
06:59.844 --> 07:03.584
- You are aware of that, right? - He is just faking it.

127
07:03.654 --> 07:05.084
If Gyu Rim had not stopped me,

128
07:05.154 --> 07:06.724
I would have killed him right then and there...

129
07:06.954 --> 07:08.724
Mu Jin, please, okay?

130
07:09.254 --> 07:10.794
How can you just spout anything when you are angry?

131
07:10.854 --> 07:13.764
- This is a police station, okay? - Chef Kim.

132
07:16.434 --> 07:20.304
I bought ointment, disinfectant, and some basic first-aid supplies.

133
07:22.304 --> 07:24.074
I will put this on myself,

134
07:24.134 --> 07:25.944
so let us just focus on the questioning.

135
07:26.604 --> 07:28.814
I am really going to get mad, okay?

136
07:29.014 --> 07:31.414
- Okay. - Unbelievable...

137
07:32.084 --> 07:36.084
I've questioned suspects for ten years. Never seen anyone like him.

138
07:36.084 --> 07:37.384
- Mr. Kim Mu Jin. - Listening.

139
07:37.754 --> 07:39.024
This is a police station, and right now,

140
07:39.024 --> 07:41.624
you are being questioned as a suspect by a detective.

141
07:41.684 --> 07:44.854
Understand? This kind of attitude...

142
07:44.924 --> 07:46.364
can be considered obstruction of justice...

143
07:46.424 --> 07:48.734
and work out very badly for you, Mr. Kim Mu Jin.

144
07:49.594 --> 07:52.634
I am sorry. I am truly sorry. I apologize.

145
07:53.264 --> 07:57.074
So you are saying that you had never even met the victim, Kang Sung Wook?

146
07:57.534 --> 08:00.404
And without even trying to hear...

147
08:00.474 --> 08:02.874
what was going on or ask any questions,

148
08:02.944 --> 08:04.614
you just blindsided him...

149
08:04.674 --> 08:09.514
- with a flying kick, right? - Hey, that punk had it coming.

150
08:09.584 --> 08:12.054
That scumbag. If I had seen him first,

151
08:12.124 --> 08:13.584
I would have kicked him into next week...

152
08:13.654 --> 08:14.654
and finished him off myself.

153
08:14.724 --> 08:17.124
- And who on earth are you? - Me?

154
08:18.624 --> 08:21.594
Well, I know these two people here very well, yes,

155
08:21.664 --> 08:23.434
and that bastard Kang Sung Wook...

156
08:27.064 --> 08:28.804
I know him well, too.

157
08:29.104 --> 08:32.374
And I saw the whole thing. I am an eyewitness.

158
08:32.444 --> 08:33.744
If you are an eyewitness,

159
08:34.244 --> 08:36.414
keep quiet until I ask you something.

160
08:39.314 --> 08:41.954
To give you an idea of how brutally you attacked him, Mr. Kim Mu Jin,

161
08:42.014 --> 08:43.514
you know Kang Sung Wook's teeth?

162
08:43.584 --> 08:46.084
He reportedly lost 8 teeth. That's 8 whole teeth!

163
08:46.424 --> 08:48.594
With this level of violence, in my opinion,

164
08:48.694 --> 08:50.294
reaching a settlement will be tough.

165
08:51.054 --> 08:52.064
I won't settle with scum like that.

166
08:52.124 --> 08:54.264
No, it is not like that.

167
08:54.364 --> 08:58.804
Six of that guy's teeth were already knocked out by me, you know?

168
08:59.204 --> 09:02.774
They were not real teeth anyway, so even if he ate sticky taffy...

169
09:02.834 --> 09:07.274
- or chewed on dried squid... - Witness, please. When I ask,

170
09:07.644 --> 09:11.314
only when I ask, okay? That's when you answer.

171
09:12.744 --> 09:13.984
Yes, okay.

172
09:15.914 --> 09:19.024
Detective, please consider the circumstances.

173
09:19.554 --> 09:20.924
That guy, Kang Sung Wook,

174
09:20.984 --> 09:23.154
is a dangerous person you cannot reason with,

175
09:23.554 --> 09:25.194
and he committed attempted murder.

176
09:25.694 --> 09:28.964
Not long ago, he even deliberately tried to hit me with his car.

177
09:29.034 --> 09:31.594
What do you mean? Tried to hit you with a car?

178
09:32.134 --> 09:33.534
- Darn it. - Is that true?

179
09:33.604 --> 09:35.934
What hospital is that bastard in?

180
09:36.004 --> 09:37.874
I'm going to kill him right now. That son of a...

181
09:38.104 --> 09:39.244
Mu Jin, calm down.

182
09:39.574 --> 09:41.174
I didn't tell you this to make you upset.

183
09:41.244 --> 09:42.244
Stay out of this. I will handle it,

184
09:42.314 --> 09:45.644
- so don't worry. - Don't do this, please. Okay?

185
09:45.984 --> 09:47.944
This isn't helping me, Mu Jin.

186
09:48.084 --> 09:50.854
Why do you keep trying to make me look like a burden?

187
09:50.914 --> 09:52.624
That bastard tried to run you over.

188
09:52.684 --> 09:55.124
- You almost died. - I didn't die.

189
09:55.184 --> 09:58.764
- I'm right here, alive. - Either way, you got hurt.

190
10:02.064 --> 10:05.764
Seeing you get hurt hurts me so much more.

191
10:06.664 --> 10:08.974
If something happens to you because of me,

192
10:09.034 --> 10:12.144
that's even worse cruelty, and pure disaster for me, Mu Jin.

193
10:13.444 --> 10:15.204
So don't do this, please.

194
10:16.574 --> 10:19.644
Even without this from you, I'm having a hard enough time.

195
10:20.084 --> 10:21.614
So please, all right?

196
10:22.184 --> 10:24.884
I'm begging you. Please don't do this.

197
10:33.724 --> 10:37.264
Hello. I'm Kim Mu Jin's attorney.

198
10:46.344 --> 10:48.344
I'm fine, really.

199
10:49.644 --> 10:51.114
That Sung Wook guy,

200
10:51.174 --> 10:53.344
Kim Mu Jin beat him up and sent him to the hospital,

201
10:53.484 --> 10:55.714
and Gyu Rim is fine, so don't worry.

202
10:57.814 --> 11:01.154
Right. I told you everything, so I'm hanging up.

203
11:08.394 --> 11:12.034
What did Heung Sik say? How is Gyu Rim?

204
11:14.134 --> 11:15.404
He said she's fine.

205
11:16.234 --> 11:17.404
She's safe.

206
11:19.804 --> 11:22.814
Thank our lucky stars.

207
11:32.724 --> 11:35.794
Now that I know Gyu Rim is unharmed,

208
11:36.824 --> 11:39.664
you come over here, will you?

209
11:40.064 --> 11:43.894
Your life is worth as much as a fly's now.

210
11:43.964 --> 11:47.104
So get over here right now.

211
11:59.644 --> 12:01.144
Will a fly swatter even work?

212
12:02.254 --> 12:05.214
- What? - I'm not a fly.

213
12:06.424 --> 12:08.384
Even if you hit me with that all day,

214
12:08.794 --> 12:10.054
I won't die.

215
12:11.024 --> 12:13.094
Don't you have a hammer or a saw?

216
12:14.394 --> 12:16.194
A hammer or a saw?

217
12:16.764 --> 12:18.334
Seriously?

218
12:19.064 --> 12:21.364
Are you picking a fight with me?

219
12:22.574 --> 12:26.004
No matter what I use to kill you, who are you...

220
12:26.074 --> 12:27.974
to tell me what weapon to choose?

221
12:28.644 --> 12:31.274
If I hit you with this until you die, then you'll die.

222
12:31.474 --> 12:34.214
Have you ever been beaten to death with a fly swatter?

223
12:34.514 --> 12:35.814
If you're going to kill me,

224
12:36.714 --> 12:39.024
just make it quick and clean in one strike.

225
12:39.984 --> 12:43.494
I have no reason to live anymore anyway,

226
12:44.054 --> 12:46.024
and I don't want to live either.

227
12:46.124 --> 12:49.264
Are you threatening an old woman right now?

228
12:50.194 --> 12:51.434
Unbelievable.

229
12:51.564 --> 12:53.664
Talk about the pot calling the kettle black.

230
12:53.734 --> 12:56.074
The nerve of you.

231
12:56.574 --> 13:00.744
Fine, you don't even deserve this flyswatter.

232
13:02.374 --> 13:04.274
I'll fetch a needle...

233
13:04.474 --> 13:05.914
and prick you slowly for a month or a year...

234
13:06.014 --> 13:11.914
in agonizing pain until you die, so get ready.

235
13:12.354 --> 13:14.884
Just finish me off in one shot.

236
13:16.124 --> 13:19.494
It's not like I'm a stranger. I'm the sister of Han Gyu Rim,

237
13:19.564 --> 13:20.924
the girl you adore so much.

238
13:21.664 --> 13:25.094
Can't you at least grant me that much mercy?

239
13:28.264 --> 13:29.874
I won't complain or resist, so take your revenge.

240
13:31.104 --> 13:34.174
Cleanly, with peace of mind.

241
13:36.474 --> 13:39.514
What kind of rotten wretch acts like this?

242
13:40.814 --> 13:42.014
Seriously.

243
13:57.994 --> 14:02.174
Fine. Let's both die today. You and me, beaten to a pulp.

244
14:02.774 --> 14:03.834
I've got to get that needle.

245
14:25.224 --> 14:26.994
Did they let you go?

246
14:27.864 --> 14:30.334
His identity is verified, and there's no flight risk,

247
14:30.764 --> 14:32.334
so he's booked without detention for now.

248
14:33.104 --> 14:35.804
- What about Gyu Rim? - She went to the restroom.

249
14:36.604 --> 14:39.244
She didn't want her family to worry, so she put on some ointment...

250
14:39.504 --> 14:41.304
and went to fix up her messy hair.

251
14:42.544 --> 14:44.544
Did anyone hear...

252
14:44.544 --> 14:46.184
which hospital Kang Sung Wook went to?

253
14:46.244 --> 14:49.154
Why? Are you going to the hospital to kill him for real?

254
14:49.254 --> 14:50.254
Yes.

255
14:50.714 --> 14:53.024
If you kill Kang Sung Wook and end up in prison,

256
14:53.224 --> 14:54.884
do you think Ms. Gyu Rim could live with herself?

257
14:55.324 --> 14:56.954
Do you really want to see her completely lose her mind?

258
14:57.024 --> 14:59.124
- You idiot. - Darn it.

259
14:59.424 --> 15:02.994
Well, not that Cricket here is wrong about anything, but...

260
15:04.694 --> 15:05.734
You know,

261
15:06.334 --> 15:10.604
seeing how fiery Mr. Kim Mu Jin was totally touched my heart.

262
15:11.904 --> 15:14.844
You are totally my style.

263
15:15.144 --> 15:18.074
I'm officially a huge fan.

264
15:18.884 --> 15:22.284
Fan, my ass. Look here, Monkey Man.

265
15:24.314 --> 15:25.314
Mu Jin,

266
15:26.254 --> 15:27.924
I'm going to drop the honorifics from now on,

267
15:28.724 --> 15:32.264
so you call me your big bro, too. You too, Cricket.

268
15:33.694 --> 15:35.494
I've got plenty of older brothers and sisters in Wando.

269
15:37.964 --> 15:40.104
We'll have to discuss that among ourselves first.

270
15:41.264 --> 15:44.134
Why is Gyu Rim taking so long? Shouldn't we go check on her?

271
15:44.974 --> 15:47.504
Why isn't the girl coming out? There she is.

272
15:49.244 --> 15:50.244
Gyu Rim.

273
15:55.284 --> 15:56.984
- Are you okay? - I'm fine.

274
15:57.184 --> 15:59.554
Are you okay? Wait, let's head to the hospital first.

275
16:00.184 --> 16:01.184
I'm really fine.

276
16:01.254 --> 16:02.824
It's really not bad enough to go to a hospital.

277
16:02.924 --> 16:03.954
No. Look, you...

278
16:04.694 --> 16:06.894
You might have a head injury, and there could be internal trauma...

279
16:06.964 --> 16:10.064
- that we can't see... - I have to go check on Gyu Young.

280
16:10.394 --> 16:11.394
Why?

281
16:14.004 --> 16:16.574
If anything feels off, I'll go to the hospital right away.

282
16:16.974 --> 16:17.974
Okay?

283
16:22.274 --> 16:23.844
What you did today, Mu Jin...

284
16:24.514 --> 16:26.914
I can't exactly shower you with praise for it,

285
16:29.954 --> 16:31.054
but thank you anyway.

286
16:34.154 --> 16:35.554
Thank you for saving me.

287
16:38.254 --> 16:39.564
But that's where this ends.

288
16:40.294 --> 16:42.164
Okay? Please.

289
16:43.264 --> 16:44.294
This is it.

290
16:46.604 --> 16:47.604
All right.

291
16:48.664 --> 16:49.674
I'm leaving.

292
16:59.814 --> 17:01.544
Please don't get hurt.

293
17:03.084 --> 17:04.084
Right.

294
17:04.214 --> 17:05.214
I'll go now.

295
17:07.384 --> 17:10.324
All right, guys. See you around.

296
17:10.924 --> 17:13.524
Cricket, you went through a lot of trouble, too.

297
17:14.424 --> 17:16.294
I'm heading out. Gyu Rim, let's go together.

298
17:17.664 --> 17:20.334
I really just want to live like a cricket,

299
17:20.404 --> 17:24.674
in peace with the beetles, chafers, and all the other bugs.

300
17:25.844 --> 17:28.704
I don't want anything to do...

301
17:28.774 --> 17:30.574
with primates like monkeys and humans, seriously.

302
17:30.644 --> 17:33.814
No, but seriously, what is wrong with her so-called family?

303
17:34.384 --> 17:35.814
You fix one mess, and another blows up.

304
17:35.914 --> 17:37.054
You fix that, and another happens.

305
17:37.284 --> 17:38.384
Are they playing Whac-A-Mole?

306
17:39.184 --> 17:40.684
Can't they just leave Gyu Rim alone for a single day...

307
17:40.754 --> 17:41.784
so she can catch her breath?

308
17:42.054 --> 17:43.154
I was scared to even breathe around her...

309
17:43.224 --> 17:44.294
in case she blew away,

310
17:45.054 --> 17:46.064
so why are they giving someone...

311
17:46.124 --> 17:47.224
as delicate as grass such a hard time?

312
17:47.294 --> 17:48.424
Those absolute bastards.

313
17:49.734 --> 17:51.964
Hey, should I just adopt Gyu Rim?

314
17:52.434 --> 17:54.364
- Did you like that? - What?

315
17:58.734 --> 17:59.874
I didn't see that coming either.

316
18:13.084 --> 18:14.084
Hey, Gyu Young.

317
18:17.194 --> 18:18.524
What are you doing sitting out here?

318
18:22.364 --> 18:23.634
Did my mom kick you out?

319
18:31.004 --> 18:32.544
This is for the meals and lodging so far.

320
18:33.104 --> 18:34.544
If it's not enough, I'll give you more later.

321
18:35.144 --> 18:36.244
Put that away.

322
18:36.414 --> 18:38.144
Since when do we charge each other for room and board?

323
18:39.644 --> 18:41.114
You got kicked out too.

324
18:41.844 --> 18:43.914
Grandma changed all the door codes...

325
18:44.214 --> 18:45.754
and said don't even think about coming back.

326
18:53.694 --> 18:54.724
Where are you going?

327
18:55.324 --> 18:56.664
Don't look down on me...

328
18:56.734 --> 18:57.794
just because I hit rock bottom like this.

329
18:57.964 --> 18:59.304
Stop pretending to care about me.

330
19:04.274 --> 19:05.274
Let go.

331
19:07.774 --> 19:11.414
Hey, let go of me. Let go of me. Hey.

332
19:12.514 --> 19:13.714
Let's go home, Gyu Young.

333
19:14.744 --> 19:16.214
Come home with me.

334
19:16.484 --> 19:20.824
No. Why would I go back there? I'd rather walk into a lion's den...

335
19:21.024 --> 19:22.794
than set foot in that house again.

336
19:23.424 --> 19:24.424
Let go.

337
19:27.724 --> 19:30.434
I'll hold onto her, so you let go.

338
19:30.834 --> 19:32.034
You're completely drained,

339
19:32.194 --> 19:33.304
and you lack the strength to breathe.

340
19:33.604 --> 19:34.634
Mister.

341
19:36.734 --> 19:37.904
I figured you would be stubborn like this,

342
19:37.974 --> 19:38.974
so I called Gyu Oh.

343
19:39.474 --> 19:41.044
- He will be here soon. - Hey.

344
19:41.104 --> 19:44.744
Yes, you are completely surrounded, so do not move and just surrender.

345
19:45.344 --> 19:48.814
Seriously. Who do you think you are?

346
19:49.014 --> 19:50.154
Wherever I go,

347
19:50.214 --> 19:52.584
why do you people have to restrict my freedom?

348
19:52.784 --> 19:54.654
Why are you meddling in my business?

349
19:54.984 --> 19:56.154
I told you to let go.

350
19:56.954 --> 19:58.154
Gosh, seriously.

351
20:06.104 --> 20:08.304
Right, I had a bad feeling.

352
20:08.834 --> 20:10.234
Ever since we met at that noodle shop,

353
20:10.404 --> 20:11.404
I knew something was up.

354
20:12.204 --> 20:13.404
Shut your mouth.

355
20:14.944 --> 20:17.514
How far did you spread the rumor?

356
20:17.674 --> 20:20.284
Did you go running to Father and Gyeol to blab that Gyu Young,

357
20:20.684 --> 20:22.214
who always acted so high and mighty,

358
20:22.284 --> 20:23.954
got totally ruined by marriage fraud?

359
20:24.454 --> 20:26.254
Why do you not just rent a loudspeaker...

360
20:26.254 --> 20:28.684
and announce it to the neighborhood, to the entire country?

361
20:29.084 --> 20:30.094
Should I?

362
20:30.524 --> 20:32.764
Gyu Oh, would you go rent a loudspeaker?

363
20:32.864 --> 20:34.064
Hey, Han Gyu Rim.

364
20:38.034 --> 20:39.464
Hey, that is mine.

365
20:39.634 --> 20:42.234
What now? Should we load you in like luggage too?

366
20:42.504 --> 20:45.534
- What? - Just say the word.

367
20:45.874 --> 20:48.544
Tossing her in like baggage is nothing to me.

368
20:49.744 --> 20:53.484
- Just get in already. - Mister, I said I am not going.

369
20:53.884 --> 20:55.614
- Just get in. - Seriously.

370
20:58.414 --> 21:00.824
Hey, get in the front. Am I your chauffeur?

371
21:00.884 --> 21:01.924
Shut up.

372
21:07.994 --> 21:08.994
Are you all right?

373
21:11.664 --> 21:12.704
Thank you, Heung Sik.

374
21:14.004 --> 21:15.034
Gyu Young...

375
21:15.904 --> 21:17.834
must have been so terrified with nowhere to go.

376
21:18.474 --> 21:21.144
Thank you so much for protecting and looking after her.

377
21:21.474 --> 21:23.974
Anyone in my shoes would have done the same.

378
21:26.344 --> 21:27.444
I will get going now.

379
21:27.984 --> 21:29.314
I will call you. Thank you.

380
21:35.484 --> 21:36.524
Wait a second, Gyu Rim.

381
21:41.194 --> 21:42.264
Well...

382
21:44.134 --> 21:45.534
Could you take me with you too?

383
21:47.304 --> 21:49.474
I doubt my mother will even open the door for me now.

384
21:50.834 --> 21:52.574
If I get on her bad side,

385
21:52.574 --> 21:54.344
there might not be anything left of me.

386
22:02.144 --> 22:03.754
So that woman...

387
22:05.084 --> 22:07.484
That stalker lady, I mean, our mother...

388
22:18.294 --> 22:20.304
How long has she been hovering around us?

389
22:21.404 --> 22:23.304
It seems she already dug up all our personal information.

390
22:25.374 --> 22:27.404
Seeing how she went to Gyu Rim's mother,

391
22:27.544 --> 22:29.044
does she know our address too?

392
22:29.844 --> 22:31.874
Is it just a matter of time before she shows up at our place?

393
22:35.514 --> 22:38.584
Do you still have feelings for Seok Joong?

394
22:38.654 --> 22:40.354
Why, you little...

395
22:41.854 --> 22:44.494
I told you to let go of this.

396
22:47.924 --> 22:49.734
It is so much more pathetic and horrible...

397
22:51.194 --> 22:54.134
than I ever thought or imagined.

398
22:57.634 --> 22:58.634
What is it?

399
23:00.074 --> 23:02.144
Are you so shocked you cannot even speak?

400
23:10.554 --> 23:13.024
What if that woman says she is moving back in?

401
23:16.794 --> 23:18.694
What do we do, Gyu Seo?

402
23:19.224 --> 23:20.424
Just let her try.

403
23:21.794 --> 23:23.494
Do you think I will just let that happen?

404
23:27.504 --> 23:29.904
I am already upset enough about Gyu Oh.

405
23:34.874 --> 23:38.744
Let us keep this between us for now.

406
23:41.484 --> 23:42.544
Let us keep it a secret.

407
23:56.864 --> 23:57.864
I...

408
23:59.534 --> 24:02.834
I told myself that if fate could show Gyu Oh mercy and heal him,

409
24:03.704 --> 24:04.974
I would forgive Dad, Gyu Young, Mom...

410
24:07.244 --> 24:08.244
No.

411
24:10.974 --> 24:14.284
I promised I'd forgive at least one of them.

412
24:16.454 --> 24:17.814
That woman is definitely out.

413
24:21.324 --> 24:24.594
Between Dad and Gyu Young, who is better? What do you think?

414
24:34.704 --> 24:38.134
Come on, just this once. Just once.

415
24:38.404 --> 24:40.474
I told you no, not even once.

416
24:42.574 --> 24:43.914
Why not?

417
24:44.444 --> 24:45.544
It is not like I am asking you...

418
24:45.614 --> 24:47.984
to give up the location of freedom fighters.

419
24:48.114 --> 24:50.354
Out of the 11 digits of your homeroom teacher's number,

420
24:50.414 --> 24:53.254
I am only asking for eight. Why can't you just give me that?

421
24:53.324 --> 24:56.594
You want the eight digits without the 010 prefix.

422
24:57.094 --> 25:00.024
You can include the 010 prefix. Just give me all 11 digits.

423
25:00.394 --> 25:01.394
No way.

424
25:01.464 --> 25:03.834
I cannot just hand out someone's personal info.

425
25:04.434 --> 25:07.934
Hey, your teacher is not a stranger. Soon, she will be family...

426
25:08.334 --> 25:10.304
I mean, your future aunt...

427
25:11.934 --> 25:16.144
Anyway, your grandpa has something he really needs to tell her.

428
25:16.544 --> 25:19.484
What could you possibly need to tell my teacher?

429
25:19.544 --> 25:21.114
Tell me first.

430
25:22.284 --> 25:25.684
Why are you so stubborn for a kid?

431
25:28.024 --> 25:29.024
What is this?

432
25:30.594 --> 25:31.594
What is all this?

433
25:32.324 --> 25:35.094
Hello, sir. Hey, Gyeol.

434
25:35.564 --> 25:36.794
Hello.

435
25:37.334 --> 25:38.534
What are you doing here?

436
25:39.034 --> 25:41.164
What is all this? Is this yours?

437
25:42.204 --> 25:44.734
- No, it is not that. - Gyu Young is coming in right now.

438
25:44.804 --> 25:46.604
Do not react, and do not pay any attention to her.

439
25:46.804 --> 25:49.574
Do not ask why she is here or question anything.

440
25:49.644 --> 25:51.274
- Just act like she is invisible. - Right.

441
25:51.914 --> 25:53.514
What are you talking about?

442
25:54.184 --> 25:56.414
Why is Gyu Young coming here so late?

443
25:56.584 --> 26:00.584
- And what do you mean, invisible? - I will explain everything later,

444
26:00.654 --> 26:02.784
so just leave Gyu Young alone tonight.

445
26:03.724 --> 26:05.494
Gyeol, when you see your aunt...

446
26:08.794 --> 26:10.194
You pretend she is invisible too.

447
26:10.394 --> 26:12.594
Should a kid really ignore an adult like that?

448
26:13.334 --> 26:15.534
No, you must greet her,

449
26:16.204 --> 26:18.904
- warmly. - I am not glad to see her at all.

450
26:20.674 --> 26:23.444
Good grief, out of the blue, talking total nonsense.

451
26:23.814 --> 26:25.714
I cannot understand a single word.

452
26:26.074 --> 26:27.544
Do you understand what they are saying?

453
26:27.744 --> 26:30.914
Yes. Not all of it, but mostly.

454
26:31.084 --> 26:33.284
Sir, you might be the real bomb here.

455
26:33.554 --> 26:36.394
Hold on, wait a second. Put this on first.

456
26:36.454 --> 26:39.594
- It is brand new. - What are you doing?

457
26:41.864 --> 26:44.094
Even if it is a bit stuffy, just bear with it for a bit, okay?

458
26:44.164 --> 26:46.404
Is it not better than having her storm right back out?

459
26:48.204 --> 26:49.774
Father, do you just want to stay in your room?

460
26:50.174 --> 26:51.274
Come with me.

461
26:51.274 --> 26:53.504
- I am not going in. - Hurry up.

462
26:53.574 --> 26:55.544
- I am not going in. Why would I... - Gyu Oh.

463
26:55.604 --> 27:00.384
Hey. I said I am not going in. I am not. Darn it...

464
27:00.444 --> 27:01.744
Darn it.

465
27:05.584 --> 27:06.584
Foot.

466
27:08.084 --> 27:09.524
- Hey. - Right foot.

467
27:09.594 --> 27:11.194
Seriously...

468
27:13.964 --> 27:17.464
- Hello, Aunt Gyu Young. - No, nothing is good.

469
27:18.264 --> 27:21.264
Father, I brought Gyu Young home.

470
27:21.864 --> 27:24.774
Cutting ties with family just felt wrong.

471
27:25.134 --> 27:26.134
Rather than staying with those people,

472
27:26.204 --> 27:28.344
living with family felt much better,

473
27:28.444 --> 27:30.014
so I just dragged her back.

474
27:56.434 --> 27:58.334
Tell her she had a rough time,

475
27:59.034 --> 28:00.304
that you are glad she is here,

476
28:01.504 --> 28:03.174
and welcome her warmly.

477
28:07.184 --> 28:08.944
Good, you held it in well.

478
28:13.684 --> 28:14.684
Sir.

479
28:30.504 --> 28:33.044
Mom, what happened to your face?

480
28:33.744 --> 28:36.514
- What is wrong with my face? - The bandage.

481
28:37.274 --> 28:38.874
Did you get into a fight?

482
28:39.844 --> 28:42.044
This? Well...

483
28:43.784 --> 28:45.354
Did you get hurt fighting...

484
28:45.884 --> 28:47.254
to bring Aunt Gyu Young back?

485
28:48.754 --> 28:49.754
Yes.

486
28:50.554 --> 28:54.694
Even grown-ups sometimes fight to protect what matters to them.

487
28:56.324 --> 28:57.694
And Mommy won.

488
28:58.894 --> 28:59.904
Mom...

489
29:34.264 --> 29:35.604
That Gyu Young...

490
29:37.334 --> 29:39.844
She got caught scamming and was kicked out, right?

491
29:40.774 --> 29:43.974
She was not kicked out. She walked out on her own two feet.

492
29:44.314 --> 29:46.374
Whether she was kicked out or walked out,

493
29:46.444 --> 29:49.014
she still got caught running a scam.

494
29:49.084 --> 29:51.454
Being kicked out versus walking out on your own...

495
29:51.514 --> 29:53.184
are totally different things.

496
29:56.924 --> 30:01.264
I knew it with that girl. She made me so anxious and uneasy.

497
30:09.704 --> 30:12.734
Gyu Young strayed for a moment...

498
30:13.504 --> 30:14.704
realized she made a mistake...

499
30:14.774 --> 30:16.574
and came back to get on the right path.

500
30:17.574 --> 30:19.114
So please, do not cry, Father.

501
30:48.174 --> 30:49.274
Aren't you going to leave?

502
30:54.784 --> 30:56.514
Must feel so satisfying, right?

503
30:56.854 --> 30:59.554
You always prayed that annoying girl would crash and burn,

504
31:00.024 --> 31:01.254
so having a front-row seat...

505
31:01.324 --> 31:03.854
to my life hitting rock bottom must be a blast.

506
31:10.564 --> 31:12.334
I will record my miserable state...

507
31:12.394 --> 31:15.004
in crystal-clear high definition and send it to you,

508
31:15.934 --> 31:19.004
so whenever you need a good laugh, put it on loop and get out.

509
31:19.104 --> 31:22.274
Get out. Stop staring and get out!

510
31:26.684 --> 31:28.214
Why would I need to stare at you?

511
31:29.014 --> 31:31.354
If I want to see someone whose life hit rock bottom in real time,

512
31:31.414 --> 31:32.654
I can just look in the mirror.

513
31:33.284 --> 31:34.554
What are you talking about?

514
31:36.524 --> 31:39.224
Is it reckoning season or something?

515
31:39.794 --> 31:41.864
The season to reap what you sow?

516
31:43.634 --> 31:46.634
You reap what you sow, plain and simple.

517
31:47.634 --> 31:49.504
Isn't the law of nature terrifying?

518
31:49.934 --> 31:51.174
What on earth are you talking about...

519
31:53.774 --> 31:57.174
Did you hit rock bottom too? Why? How?

520
31:57.874 --> 32:00.144
Grandma Su Nam told me you became a clothing store owner.

521
32:00.344 --> 32:01.344
Was she lying?

522
32:03.014 --> 32:04.984
I planted bad seeds in the past,

523
32:05.554 --> 32:07.254
thinking if I deceived people well enough,

524
32:07.354 --> 32:08.724
good things might sprout,

525
32:09.384 --> 32:10.924
but they grew into bad seeds anyway.

526
32:13.494 --> 32:15.664
A middle school dropout is using metaphors on a PhD?

527
32:15.994 --> 32:17.934
Have you been hanging out with smart people lately?

528
32:26.234 --> 32:27.244
What is this, anyway?

529
32:28.044 --> 32:30.574
I hit absolute rock bottom, and climbed back up today.

530
32:31.674 --> 32:35.184
Thanks to Gyu Rim, Gyu Seo, Gyu Min, and our family.

531
32:36.214 --> 32:38.854
Because Gyu Rim and the twins held my hand.

532
32:41.024 --> 32:42.554
I will hold your hand too,

533
32:43.054 --> 32:44.054
so take it and climb back up.

534
32:48.224 --> 32:49.224
No thanks.

535
32:49.964 --> 32:52.834
Go dance around in a circle or play patty-cake all you want.

536
32:54.864 --> 32:56.804
Do not dare interfere in my life.

537
32:57.334 --> 32:58.374
I am not like you guys.

538
32:58.434 --> 33:00.174
Even at my lowest, I am still Han Gyu Young, got it?

539
33:01.674 --> 33:03.744
Han Gyu Young is here? On the second floor?

540
33:04.214 --> 33:06.844
Yes, Mom brought Aunt Gyu Young back.

541
33:07.484 --> 33:08.614
No way.

542
33:15.454 --> 33:16.694
My mom got hurt.

543
33:17.254 --> 33:19.494
She got into a fight trying to bring Aunt Gyu Young.

544
33:19.654 --> 33:20.694
Really?

545
33:21.664 --> 33:23.164
Act like you do not know.

546
33:24.894 --> 33:27.464
Mom told us to give her a warm welcome...

547
33:27.534 --> 33:29.564
and tell her she went through a lot.

548
33:30.434 --> 33:31.434
Unbelievable.

549
33:33.034 --> 33:34.974
The good old days are gone now.

550
34:25.794 --> 34:26.794
Are you crying?

551
34:31.694 --> 34:32.764
I want to cry,

552
34:34.134 --> 34:35.234
but tears won't come out.

553
34:37.334 --> 34:39.604
Old sayings are never wrong.

554
34:39.704 --> 34:41.404
Standing next to a bad person gets you struck by...

555
34:43.474 --> 34:46.144
I just heard a line like that in a drama a while ago.

556
34:46.984 --> 34:48.384
Has the writer lost her mind?

557
34:48.844 --> 34:50.554
So nobody should be around a difficult person?

558
34:51.114 --> 34:52.254
The world is already harsh enough,

559
34:52.314 --> 34:54.084
and here they are encouraging ostracism on TV.

560
34:54.154 --> 34:56.354
I am definitely leaving hate comments for that writer.

561
34:59.324 --> 35:00.424
About Kang Sung Wook...

562
35:01.524 --> 35:02.764
Are you really not going to settle with him?

563
35:02.964 --> 35:03.964
I'm not.

564
35:04.234 --> 35:07.034
Leave your emotions out of this and use your head.

565
35:07.764 --> 35:10.404
Whatever the circumstances were, we live in a nation of law,

566
35:10.404 --> 35:13.274
and you committed serious violence.

567
35:13.334 --> 35:14.644
If you get punished for that violence,

568
35:15.144 --> 35:17.774
how do you think Gyu Rim will feel? Aren't you thinking about Gyu Rim?

569
35:22.414 --> 35:25.484
Why do I care more about Gyu Rim than you do?

570
35:26.884 --> 35:27.884
Wait, what?

571
35:28.054 --> 35:30.624
I came in here to badmouth Gyu Rim.

572
35:31.254 --> 35:33.524
Darn it, I'm confused.

573
35:57.684 --> 35:58.684
Hello?

574
35:59.484 --> 36:00.984
Is this Mr. Kim Mu Jin?

575
36:03.424 --> 36:04.424
Yes, it is.

576
36:05.594 --> 36:06.594
Who is this?

577
36:07.994 --> 36:08.994
My name is...

578
36:09.664 --> 36:10.994
Lee Hyun Beom.

579
36:11.364 --> 36:12.364
Pardon?

580
36:12.964 --> 36:13.964
Who?

581
36:15.734 --> 36:17.074
Lee Hyun Beom...

582
36:18.874 --> 36:21.104
I'm sorry, but that name doesn't ring a bell.

583
36:23.244 --> 36:24.244
Hello?

584
36:25.314 --> 36:26.614
You know Han Gyeol, right?

585
36:28.284 --> 36:29.514
Han Gyu Rim's son.

586
36:31.884 --> 36:33.154
Yes, I do.

587
36:34.454 --> 36:38.094
I believe I am Gyeol's biological father.

588
36:40.894 --> 36:41.894
What?

589
37:04.684 --> 37:06.414
Gyeol, lift your head for a second.

590
37:28.204 --> 37:29.344
It's all right.

591
37:30.874 --> 37:32.244
This too shall pass.

592
37:34.114 --> 37:35.144
Right, Gyeol?

593
37:37.784 --> 37:39.284
Everything will be fine.

594
37:41.784 --> 37:42.784
Right?

595
38:05.774 --> 38:08.644
(Seo Min Ju)

596
38:27.434 --> 38:29.534
(Seo Min Ju)

597
38:39.314 --> 38:41.544
So you do pick up?

598
38:47.154 --> 38:50.554
I thought you blocked my number, but you answered.

599
38:53.094 --> 38:54.094
Hello?

600
38:55.064 --> 38:56.594
Are you listening to me right now?

601
38:58.564 --> 39:02.064
Kwon Hee Na. I asked if you're listening to me.

602
39:05.304 --> 39:06.304
Hello?

603
39:07.604 --> 39:08.604
Hello?

604
39:10.244 --> 39:11.314
Hey, Kwon Hee Na.

605
39:12.114 --> 39:13.144
Can't you hear me?

606
39:14.414 --> 39:15.414
Hey!

607
39:17.054 --> 39:19.284
She really won't answer. Darn it.

608
39:34.034 --> 39:35.064
Don't go, you can't.

609
39:36.904 --> 39:37.904
Hee Na, don't leave me.

610
40:24.284 --> 40:25.284
Gyu Rim.

611
40:25.714 --> 40:26.754
Yes?

612
40:40.194 --> 40:42.334
Did Father ask you to make ramyeon at the crack of dawn?

613
40:43.634 --> 40:45.334
Is Heung Sik eating too?

614
40:46.974 --> 40:49.674
- Still, seven packs is a bit... - No, it's mine.

615
40:50.274 --> 40:52.344
I just suddenly had a craving for ramyeon.

616
40:54.214 --> 40:56.514
You don't mean you're going to eat all this, right?

617
40:57.254 --> 40:59.954
I'm eating it all. This is all mine,

618
41:00.014 --> 41:01.584
so if you want some, make it yourself.

619
41:03.894 --> 41:05.254
I should add some cold rice too.

620
41:05.754 --> 41:07.324
There must be leftover rice somewhere.

621
41:08.094 --> 41:09.464
Gyu Min, you're up early.

622
41:09.924 --> 41:10.934
Yes.

623
41:11.534 --> 41:13.734
Where is it?

624
41:16.164 --> 41:17.504
Here it is.

625
41:39.994 --> 41:40.994
Han Gyu Seo.

626
41:41.794 --> 41:42.794
Han Gyu Seo, wake up.

627
41:43.934 --> 41:45.064
Get up already.

628
41:45.894 --> 41:48.464
I just fell asleep at dawn. Five more minutes.

629
41:50.534 --> 41:54.404
Gyu Rim made ramyeon. Seven packs, all at once.

630
41:54.604 --> 41:55.844
And she's planning to eat it all by herself.

631
41:55.904 --> 41:58.014
Get up already.

632
42:01.714 --> 42:02.714
Seven packs?

633
42:04.154 --> 42:05.154
Yes.

634
42:05.284 --> 42:06.654
She said she's adding rice today, too.

635
42:07.684 --> 42:08.684
Adding rice as well?

636
42:31.814 --> 42:32.814
Hey.

637
42:37.714 --> 42:39.414
Why are you eating someone else's food?

638
42:39.714 --> 42:41.354
I told you to make your own.

639
42:42.324 --> 42:44.824
Ramyeon always tastes best when someone else makes it.

640
42:48.424 --> 42:50.164
You are unbelievable.

641
43:03.444 --> 43:04.444
Han Gyu Oh.

642
43:06.114 --> 43:08.784
Spit, spit, spit. It's all mine now.

643
43:08.844 --> 43:09.844
I'm going to eat all of it.

644
43:12.254 --> 43:14.284
How can you eat all of that?

645
43:14.454 --> 43:15.484
Are you trying to burst your stomach?

646
43:15.554 --> 43:16.724
Have you lost your mind?

647
43:16.984 --> 43:17.994
Seriously.

648
43:22.424 --> 43:24.534
We're family, let's share at least a few noodles.

649
43:25.564 --> 43:28.864
- Hey, didn't you see me spit in it? - You're my brother, who cares?

650
43:29.464 --> 43:30.634
It's not like you're contagious.

651
43:34.744 --> 43:37.644
Fine, you guys can have it all. I'll just make some more.

652
43:47.854 --> 43:49.754
Why are there only four left?

653
43:50.694 --> 43:53.294
I want some ramyeon too. Save some for me.

654
43:53.724 --> 43:54.724
Gyu Min.

655
43:58.294 --> 43:59.434
This is so good.

656
44:03.464 --> 44:04.904
Me too, give me some first.

657
44:07.574 --> 44:10.204
Dad, you like raw ramyeon, right?

658
44:10.844 --> 44:11.874
What?

659
44:13.114 --> 44:16.414
Take these and crush them up to eat right away.

660
44:16.414 --> 44:17.714
Before Gyu Rim cooks them.

661
44:19.854 --> 44:21.154
Gyu Rim is making ramyeon?

662
44:22.754 --> 44:24.394
- All four packs? - Yes.

663
44:25.054 --> 44:27.494
That's only because we have four left in the house.

664
44:28.194 --> 44:30.264
Anyway, the first batch of seven packs...

665
44:30.324 --> 44:31.734
is being eaten by Gyu Oh and Gyu Seo.

666
44:32.664 --> 44:33.664
I worried their stomachs might burst.

667
44:33.734 --> 44:37.134
I have to go help them out. Please finish these off, Dad.

668
44:37.204 --> 44:38.374
Got it? Hurry.

669
44:42.074 --> 44:43.904
She made seven packs of ramyeon?

670
44:44.444 --> 44:47.444
What? What do you mean Gyu Rim...

671
44:47.514 --> 44:49.814
made seven packs of ramyeon first thing in the morning?

672
44:50.714 --> 44:52.954
She doesn't even like ramyeon that much.

673
44:53.684 --> 44:54.684
Two years ago,

674
44:56.284 --> 44:58.594
Gyu Oh, Gyu Seo, Gyu Young, and I...

675
45:00.094 --> 45:01.264
the four of us together...

676
45:02.124 --> 45:04.164
really upset her once.

677
45:05.534 --> 45:06.764
Back then, she cooked five packs of ramyeon...

678
45:06.834 --> 45:08.434
and ate them all by herself.

679
45:08.734 --> 45:09.734
Pardon?

680
45:10.774 --> 45:12.634
Five packs all by herself?

681
45:13.934 --> 45:18.444
It's not like she's a mukbang star. Didn't her stomach burst from that?

682
45:19.314 --> 45:20.314
It didn't burst,

683
45:21.844 --> 45:23.884
but she had indigestion, threw up, and suffered a lot.

684
45:25.014 --> 45:27.584
I really thought she was going to die back then.

685
45:29.584 --> 45:30.584
Is that so?

686
45:50.714 --> 45:51.714
Hey, eat slowly.

687
45:51.774 --> 45:52.944
Get some digestive medicine and take it too.

688
45:53.574 --> 45:55.944
While I am getting the medicine, do you plan to eat it all?

689
45:56.644 --> 45:59.454
You should eat slowly too. Are you not on a diet?

690
46:00.154 --> 46:02.084
You must have eaten three packs by yourself.

691
46:02.254 --> 46:04.194
Why are you swallowing the ramyeon without even chewing?

692
46:04.324 --> 46:05.794
Take some medicine later.

693
46:08.224 --> 46:09.964
- Hey, give me some more. - I am fine.

694
46:10.024 --> 46:11.034
I will eat it all.

695
46:11.434 --> 46:13.694
- Let me have it. - Hey, there is more here.

696
46:14.704 --> 46:15.964
Bring it over, hold out your bowl.

697
46:16.434 --> 46:19.304
- Seriously, you are so petty. - Stop fighting, you guys.

698
46:20.234 --> 46:21.244
Hold out your bowl.

699
46:35.124 --> 46:36.354
You know potatoes, right?

700
46:37.424 --> 46:38.424
What?

701
46:39.094 --> 46:42.724
Even if a farmer sows the same seeds,

702
46:42.894 --> 46:44.694
waters them, and tends them with care,

703
46:46.264 --> 46:49.304
not every potato grows the same way.

704
46:49.734 --> 46:50.734
That is what my mother said.

705
46:52.234 --> 46:55.674
Some potatoes grow admirable and fine,

706
46:56.874 --> 47:01.214
while others turn out bad and grow however they want.

707
47:06.754 --> 47:07.754
Even so,

708
47:08.524 --> 47:10.624
even those bad potatoes that grow wild,

709
47:12.024 --> 47:14.054
they know how hard the farmer worked,

710
47:14.824 --> 47:17.634
through droughts and floods,

711
47:18.234 --> 47:19.994
and with what anxious care...

712
47:20.064 --> 47:21.434
the farmer raised each single potato.

713
47:23.204 --> 47:24.974
She said they know all of that deep down.

714
47:44.424 --> 47:46.194
Gyu Rim made seven packs of ramyeon.

715
47:47.894 --> 47:50.894
So grab your chopsticks and go help her out.

716
47:51.464 --> 47:52.864
You little bad potato.

717
47:53.364 --> 47:54.464
It is not because of me.

718
47:55.304 --> 47:56.464
It is because of Han Gyu Oh.

719
47:57.404 --> 48:01.004
He already caused all the trouble, and I just jumped on the bandwagon.

720
48:01.074 --> 48:02.774
Bandwagon, my foot.

721
48:03.274 --> 48:06.644
Because of you, Sung Wook almost ran Gyu Rim over,

722
48:06.714 --> 48:07.884
and she got kicked and beaten up...

723
48:07.944 --> 48:08.944
What are you talking about?

724
48:12.554 --> 48:14.724
Kang Sung Wook, that bastard wants to die, darn it.

725
48:19.624 --> 48:22.564
Mu Jin already avenged her plenty.

726
48:23.594 --> 48:26.334
He knocked all of Kang Sung Wook's teeth out,

727
48:26.394 --> 48:28.104
broke all his bones,

728
48:28.164 --> 48:29.564
and sent him packing to kingdom come.

729
48:32.574 --> 48:34.504
That punk is admitted to a hospital right now, so...

730
48:34.574 --> 48:35.574
Which hospital?

731
48:36.344 --> 48:38.614
Mu Jin can handle his own revenge,

732
48:39.344 --> 48:40.674
and I will handle mine.

733
48:41.384 --> 48:42.644
I am going to kill him.

734
48:43.044 --> 48:44.044
Hey.

735
48:45.984 --> 48:48.624
If you throw a fit and run wild too,

736
48:49.184 --> 48:51.854
your sister will have to make and eat ten packs of ramyeon.

737
48:52.594 --> 48:53.594
Darn it.

738
48:57.124 --> 48:59.164
You're a good girl after all.

739
49:02.104 --> 49:04.574
It must have been so exhausting pretending to be bad all this time.

740
49:24.794 --> 49:25.824
Hello?

741
49:26.894 --> 49:27.894
Han Gyeol?

742
49:28.194 --> 49:29.194
Yes?

743
49:30.824 --> 49:32.534
Did I wake you up?

744
49:32.894 --> 49:35.964
No. I woke up a while ago,

745
49:36.234 --> 49:37.904
but I am just too lazy to get up.

746
49:39.274 --> 49:41.204
Who is this, though?

747
49:41.974 --> 49:43.744
Well, I am...

748
49:44.544 --> 49:47.214
You remember the other day...

749
49:47.414 --> 49:49.614
when you recommended that great tteokbokki place?

750
49:49.684 --> 49:51.054
I am that lady.

751
49:52.014 --> 49:53.684
I remember.

752
49:54.184 --> 49:55.524
Hello.

753
49:57.154 --> 49:58.154
Right. Well...

754
49:58.454 --> 50:03.594
I am going to that tteokbokki place for lunch later.

755
50:04.464 --> 50:06.494
Do you want to have lunch with me?

756
50:07.464 --> 50:10.434
My mom told me not to follow strangers...

757
50:10.434 --> 50:12.404
even if they offer to buy me food.

758
50:15.844 --> 50:18.044
But I am not a stranger.

759
50:21.584 --> 50:24.584
You know Mu Jin, right?

760
50:25.554 --> 50:26.554
I am...

761
50:27.584 --> 50:29.884
I am Mu Jin's mother.

762
50:30.854 --> 50:31.854
Really?

763
50:33.324 --> 50:36.124
Yes. Why would I lie to you?

764
50:37.864 --> 50:41.504
If you need proof, I can send you a picture of me...

765
50:41.564 --> 50:43.804
with Mu Jin. Hold on.

766
50:48.744 --> 50:50.744
(Han Gyeol)

767
50:53.814 --> 50:56.844
Han Gyeol, keep this picture to yourself.

768
50:56.914 --> 51:00.114
And could you keep my call a secret from your mom...

769
51:00.184 --> 51:01.754
for a while?

770
51:02.524 --> 51:03.924
Can you do that for me?

771
51:07.094 --> 51:08.094
Okay, good.

772
51:08.764 --> 51:09.764
All right, then.

773
51:10.164 --> 51:12.094
I will see you at the tteokbokki place later.

774
51:12.164 --> 51:13.164
I will be waiting.

775
51:25.314 --> 51:26.574
You did great, Mom.

776
51:27.214 --> 51:29.544
- You did so well. - What is with you?

777
51:29.614 --> 51:31.484
Hey, were you eavesdropping out there?

778
51:33.384 --> 51:37.284
If you are so curious, why do you not just wiretap my room?

779
51:37.424 --> 51:39.954
Can I do that? Can I wiretap you?

780
51:42.664 --> 51:45.234
- You did great, Mom. - Get away from me.

781
51:45.294 --> 51:47.194
- Now you finally feel like my mom. - Go away.

782
51:48.704 --> 51:49.704
I see.

783
51:50.204 --> 51:51.404
So the current situation is...

784
51:52.274 --> 51:53.974
Kang Sang Man and Shim Su Ji...

785
51:53.974 --> 51:57.104
have been arrested for fraud, extortion, and threats.

786
51:57.474 --> 51:59.244
Given their prior records for similar offenses...

787
51:59.314 --> 52:00.774
and the recognized flight risk,

788
52:00.974 --> 52:03.114
they will stand trial while in custody.

789
52:03.684 --> 52:06.584
- That is good news. - As I reported last night,

790
52:06.814 --> 52:09.384
Kang Sung Wook faces additional charges...

791
52:09.554 --> 52:11.224
for assaulting Han Gyu Rim and a hit-and-run,

792
52:11.454 --> 52:13.424
so he will also be indicted and tried.

793
52:14.124 --> 52:15.164
By the way,

794
52:16.624 --> 52:19.264
as for Han Gyu Young's divorce, can we speed things up a bit?

795
52:19.934 --> 52:20.934
Yes.

796
52:20.994 --> 52:22.904
With criminal charges also piling up,

797
52:23.304 --> 52:25.374
Kang Sung Wook's side has decided...

798
52:25.434 --> 52:26.974
there is nothing to gain by dragging this out.

799
52:27.504 --> 52:30.274
So I believe it will be settled by mutual agreement.

800
52:31.144 --> 52:34.344
At this rate, it should wrap up in about a month.

801
52:35.084 --> 52:39.284
I see. Just see it through to the end and do your best.

802
52:39.484 --> 52:40.554
Attorney Kim.

803
52:41.284 --> 52:42.554
You remember that Gyu Young must not know...

804
52:42.624 --> 52:47.154
- I am involved in this, right? - Yes, of course.

805
52:47.794 --> 52:48.794
Hold on.

806
52:49.994 --> 52:51.594
(Gyu Young)

807
52:53.594 --> 52:54.934
We have nothing left to discuss, right?

808
52:55.504 --> 52:57.234
- That's all, sir. - All right, good job.

809
52:58.234 --> 53:00.204
- Thank you. - Thank you, sir.

810
53:00.274 --> 53:01.274
- Yes. - Yes.

811
53:03.574 --> 53:04.614
Hello?

812
53:07.544 --> 53:08.584
Is that so?

813
53:10.944 --> 53:13.554
Then let us meet at the office in 30 minutes.

814
53:14.524 --> 53:15.524
All right.

815
53:19.854 --> 53:20.894
Secretary Jeong.

816
53:21.394 --> 53:22.724
Do not let anyone in.

817
53:23.364 --> 53:24.494
Yes, understood.

818
53:24.764 --> 53:25.764
Have some.

819
53:32.134 --> 53:34.104
My divorce will be settled soon.

820
53:35.074 --> 53:36.404
Without your help, Chairman Jang.

821
53:38.974 --> 53:39.974
That is good.

822
53:43.084 --> 53:44.654
Mistaking a favor for an entitlement,

823
53:45.114 --> 53:47.114
and acting out like a nobody who did not know her place...

824
53:47.784 --> 53:48.824
I am sorry for that.

825
53:56.164 --> 53:58.534
I told you not to let anyone in, didn't I?

826
54:03.104 --> 54:04.134
Seo Hyun, what is it?

827
54:08.074 --> 54:09.674
Didn't you see me in the elevator?

828
54:11.814 --> 54:12.814
No, I didn't.

829
54:13.414 --> 54:15.114
We made eye contact.

830
54:15.344 --> 54:17.644
I tried to say hello, but you ignored me and walked off.

831
54:17.644 --> 54:18.714
Seo Hyun.

832
54:20.354 --> 54:22.184
Was I supposed to greet you in front of the employees?

833
54:22.624 --> 54:23.884
Saying you are the daughter my mom raised,

834
54:23.954 --> 54:25.494
and I am the daughter she gave birth to?

835
54:25.624 --> 54:27.894
- Should I have shouted that out? - Who does she think she is?

836
54:27.964 --> 54:30.964
Hey. How old are you? You are a year younger than me.

837
54:31.024 --> 54:32.194
Where do you get off mouthing off like that?

838
54:32.434 --> 54:33.434
Jang Seo Hyun.

839
54:40.234 --> 54:42.244
I do not know how long...

840
54:42.404 --> 54:44.874
your power and money will last, or how great you think you are,

841
54:45.474 --> 54:47.614
but I am not the kind of person who will just roll over and die.

842
54:48.814 --> 54:50.614
Who does she think she is, talking to you like that?

843
54:50.784 --> 54:51.784
Seo Hyun.

844
54:54.184 --> 54:55.654
Go on. Keep going.

845
54:57.784 --> 54:59.694
Whether by taking the elevator or climbing the ladder,

846
55:00.054 --> 55:02.794
I will make sure I reach where you are, Chairman Jang.

847
55:03.094 --> 55:04.734
The pain you caused me,

848
55:04.934 --> 55:06.694
and the tears of blood you made me cry...

849
55:07.194 --> 55:08.664
I will pay it all back to you.

850
55:09.934 --> 55:11.234
I will make sure...

851
55:11.804 --> 55:13.004
you regret it just as much as I did.

852
55:13.804 --> 55:16.844
- That is what I came to tell you. - Unbelievable.

853
55:17.374 --> 55:19.944
Who does she think she is, daring to talk like that to my dad?

854
55:20.044 --> 55:21.544
Just stay out of this.

855
55:25.184 --> 55:26.184
All right.

856
55:28.124 --> 55:30.454
Make me regret it until I weep tears of blood.

857
55:31.124 --> 55:32.294
Please do.

858
55:32.954 --> 55:35.294
I will be looking forward to it and waiting.

859
55:42.264 --> 55:43.264
Wait,

860
55:44.674 --> 55:47.434
what are you looking forward to?

861
55:47.604 --> 55:49.944
Why are you even entertaining that crazy girl?

862
55:50.144 --> 55:51.544
You are making no sense at all right now.

863
55:51.644 --> 55:52.714
Do you realize how bizarre you are being?

864
55:55.114 --> 55:57.544
Man, I am hungry. You haven't had lunch yet, right?

865
55:57.944 --> 55:59.254
Let's go have some ox bone soup together.

866
55:59.384 --> 56:01.884
- Let's go. - No, wait.

867
56:07.054 --> 56:09.264
The apple truly does not fall far from the tree.

868
56:10.494 --> 56:12.194
- An apple? - What?

869
56:12.794 --> 56:13.864
No, it is nothing.

870
56:14.494 --> 56:15.504
Eat up.

871
56:16.234 --> 56:18.534
- Thank you for the food. - Sure.

872
56:27.114 --> 56:28.444
- Excuse me, though. - Yes?

873
56:28.444 --> 56:31.714
Why didn't you tell me last time that you were Mu Jin's mother?

874
56:32.854 --> 56:33.884
What?

875
56:35.354 --> 56:37.254
Well, last time...

876
56:38.394 --> 56:41.864
Back then, I had not given my blessing...

877
56:41.924 --> 56:44.594
to your mom and Mu Jin yet.

878
56:47.234 --> 56:51.134
Well, anyway, it was just complicated.

879
56:53.174 --> 56:54.804
The spicy rice cakes are delicious.

880
56:56.074 --> 56:57.074
Eat up.

881
56:59.014 --> 57:00.544
Was it because I am a burden?

882
57:03.044 --> 57:04.114
What?

883
57:04.714 --> 57:06.254
Did you not approve of them...

884
57:06.984 --> 57:08.584
because I was holding them back?

885
57:11.124 --> 57:12.354
No, of course not.

886
57:12.954 --> 57:14.764
No, it is nothing like that.

887
57:15.694 --> 57:18.434
Why would you be a burden? You are not a burden at all.

888
57:19.134 --> 57:20.264
You are a blessing, a real blessing.

889
57:23.704 --> 57:25.504
You are a little bundle of joy, Gyeol.

890
57:26.074 --> 57:28.774
That is why I am trying to arrange...

891
57:28.844 --> 57:31.274
for your mother and Mu Jin to get married.

892
57:34.844 --> 57:37.914
Don't cry.

893
57:39.354 --> 57:41.754
I am so sorry.

894
57:42.484 --> 57:44.324
It is okay. Eat. What would you like?

895
57:44.384 --> 57:47.124
Would you like more rice cakes? Do you want to eat this?

896
57:47.654 --> 57:48.664
Some gimbap?

897
57:49.164 --> 57:50.994
You are saying you are Gyeol's biological father?

898
57:53.464 --> 57:54.464
Yes.

899
57:55.464 --> 57:56.934
I am Gyeol's biological father.

900
58:01.744 --> 58:02.774
I mean...

901
58:05.414 --> 58:07.714
This is totally out of the blue.

902
58:09.714 --> 58:11.784
Showing up out of nowhere, what on earth is...

903
58:13.614 --> 58:15.424
What kind of ridiculous situation is this?

904
58:16.624 --> 58:18.124
Gyu Rim, Hye Jeong, and I...

905
58:19.594 --> 58:21.354
Gyeol's biological mother and I,

906
58:22.394 --> 58:24.064
the three of us were elementary school classmates.

907
58:26.864 --> 58:28.734
I contacted Gyeol's biological mother and confirmed...

908
58:29.434 --> 58:31.874
that she had left Gyeol in Gyu Rim's care.

909
58:40.944 --> 58:41.944
Gyeol is not...

910
58:44.954 --> 58:48.014
my biological son.

911
58:52.754 --> 58:54.324
He is my friend's son.

912
58:57.094 --> 58:59.094
My friend wasn't able to raise him,

913
59:01.634 --> 59:02.834
so I raised him.

914
59:03.664 --> 59:04.704
My Gyeol.

915
59:08.174 --> 59:10.774
I also checked the hospital records of Gyeol's birth.

916
59:15.614 --> 59:18.144
And I confirmed that the baby Gyu Rim gave birth to was stillborn.

917
59:20.954 --> 59:24.784
The angel must have...

918
59:26.524 --> 59:27.854
lost their way for a moment.

919
59:31.064 --> 59:32.564
As soon as they came into the world,

920
59:37.104 --> 59:38.234
they went right back...

921
59:39.134 --> 59:40.174
to the other side.

922
59:44.244 --> 59:45.714
Please excuse me while I use the restroom.

923
59:46.844 --> 59:48.584
I have already finished the DNA test as well.

924
59:56.184 --> 59:57.184
What?

925
59:58.224 --> 59:59.694
Not by meeting him in person,

926
01:00:00.094 --> 01:00:01.494
but with a strand of hair the child dropped.

927
01:00:03.424 --> 01:00:05.994
I wanted to be absolutely certain, not just rely on assumptions.

928
01:00:06.094 --> 01:00:07.094
Only then...

929
01:00:09.034 --> 01:00:10.934
would I be able to make a decision.

930
01:00:13.634 --> 01:00:14.774
A decision?

931
01:00:16.204 --> 01:00:17.544
What kind of decision?

932
01:01:01.514 --> 01:01:02.984
I am sorry, Gyu Rim.

933
01:01:12.734 --> 01:01:14.564
I was wrong.

934
01:01:21.104 --> 01:01:22.274
I am sorry.

935
01:01:24.704 --> 01:01:26.744
I am so, so sorry.

936
01:01:37.354 --> 01:01:38.894
I am sorry, Gyu Rim.

937
01:01:41.194 --> 01:01:42.424
I am sorry.

938
01:01:50.004 --> 01:01:51.504
This feels so refreshing.

939
01:01:52.734 --> 01:01:55.574
Who are you to keep calling me Mom?

940
01:01:56.344 --> 01:01:57.904
I have never had...

941
01:01:58.004 --> 01:01:59.674
a rotten scoundrel like you as a son.

942
01:02:01.044 --> 01:02:02.184
Forget it, hang up.

943
01:02:03.344 --> 01:02:05.854
Good grief, you would sell out your own mother...

944
01:02:05.854 --> 01:02:07.084
for dirt, you bastard.

945
01:02:09.784 --> 01:02:13.194
To think I gave birth to such an ungrateful bastard...

946
01:02:13.254 --> 01:02:15.524
and drank seaweed soup afterward.

947
01:02:20.594 --> 01:02:22.104
Did you rent this place?

948
01:02:22.804 --> 01:02:24.234
Are you not minding your store?

949
01:02:26.274 --> 01:02:28.104
I connected everything to my phone...

950
01:02:28.174 --> 01:02:30.204
so it rings when a customer comes in.

951
01:02:30.574 --> 01:02:32.614
Normally, I would move out of your way,

952
01:02:32.874 --> 01:02:35.614
but I have been under so much stress.

953
01:02:35.844 --> 01:02:38.614
Lying down like this for even 30 minutes...

954
01:02:38.984 --> 01:02:40.654
relieves the stress in my body.

955
01:02:47.924 --> 01:02:50.124
Go ahead, then. If you are stressed,

956
01:02:50.294 --> 01:02:52.134
let it all out here before you leave.

957
01:02:52.764 --> 01:02:56.604
That way, you will not take it out on poor Gyeol's Mom, right?

958
01:02:57.834 --> 01:02:58.834
Oh my.

959
01:03:00.134 --> 01:03:01.844
Who is that woman?

960
01:03:02.804 --> 01:03:05.074
Isn't that woman Gyu Rim's mom?

961
01:03:08.944 --> 01:03:09.944
Who?

962
01:03:10.514 --> 01:03:13.984
Why on earth is she on her knees on the ground?

963
01:03:15.854 --> 01:03:17.184
What is going on?

964
01:03:25.494 --> 01:03:27.934
You really had an ulterior motive.

965
01:03:28.704 --> 01:03:31.804
You actually intended to get back with Seok Joong.

966
01:03:33.474 --> 01:03:35.304
When I said I wanted to get back with him,

967
01:03:35.474 --> 01:03:37.874
you got jealous all over again.

968
01:03:38.404 --> 01:03:42.244
Because Seok Joong is so wonderful, you got jealous again.

969
01:03:45.044 --> 01:03:48.154
Leave, Yoon Hee.

970
01:03:49.124 --> 01:03:50.324
This is not a place you can just return to...

971
01:03:50.384 --> 01:03:53.454
whenever you want, so leave.

972
01:03:55.824 --> 01:03:59.134
Leave. Get out of here.

973
01:04:00.864 --> 01:04:02.134
Take your hands off her.

974
01:04:03.464 --> 01:04:05.274
Don't you dare touch my mom!

975
01:04:06.404 --> 01:04:08.544
Who do you think you are putting your hands on her?

976
01:04:10.044 --> 01:04:12.514
I said, don't touch my mom!

977
01:04:45.244 --> 01:04:47.244
(Love on the Menu)

978
01:04:47.344 --> 01:04:49.484
Do you have feelings for me by any chance?

979
01:04:49.644 --> 01:04:51.854
You are the very first person in my whole life.

980
01:04:51.914 --> 01:04:55.114
- I have an eight-year-old son. - What are you talking about?

981
01:04:55.184 --> 01:04:56.854
Can't we walk without holding hands?

982
01:04:56.924 --> 01:04:59.824
People might think you're my dad.

983
01:04:59.824 --> 01:05:01.394
Well, I might as well be your dad.

984
01:05:01.454 --> 01:05:02.494
Let's emigrate together.

985
01:05:02.564 --> 01:05:04.994
- Did something happen? - You can't take Gyeol.

986
01:05:05.064 --> 01:05:06.334
I will file a lawsuit if I have to.

987
01:05:06.564 --> 01:05:08.094
- What? - Han Gyeol.

988
01:05:08.164 --> 01:05:09.804
So blood really is thicker than water?

989
01:05:09.864 --> 01:05:13.304
- Blood ties are everything? - Who are you?
